      "name": "音符字段",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-field",
      "description": "音高、位置与音长等字段。",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input-field\" aria-label=\"所选位置\" value=\"1\" />",
      "css": ".ds-input-field{font:inherit;font-size:11px;color:var(--text);background:var(--canvas);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:7px;caret-color:var(--gold);outline:none;transition:background-color 140ms,color 140ms,border-color 140ms;}.ds-input-field:focus{border-color:var(--gold)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-input-field{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "面板标签",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-tab",
      "description": "演奏与设置共享面板。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav-tabs\" aria-label=\"面板\"><button class=\"ds-nav-tab ds-selected\" aria-current=\"page\">演奏</button><button class=\"ds-nav-tab\">设置</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav-tabs{display:flex;gap:21px;height:62px}.ds-nav-tab{font:inherit;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:transparent;padding:2px 0 0;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 140ms,color 140ms,border-color 140ms;}.ds-nav-tab.ds-selected{color:var(--gold);border-bottom-color:var(--gold)}.ds-nav-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-tab{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "对话框",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "dialog",
      "description": "导入、导出与确认操作。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-dialog\" aria-label=\"导入曲谱\"><header>导入曲谱</header><div>简谱、MIDI、JSON 或 TXT</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-dialog{color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;width:420px;max-width:calc(100vw - 40px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.ds-dialog header{padding:17px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-family:\"Noto Serif SC\",serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600}.ds-dialog>div{padding:23px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9}"
    },
    {
      "name": "钢琴卷音符",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "roll-note-mid",
      "description": "宽度对应时长，分音区使用不同背景。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-roll-note\" aria-label=\"音符 1 第1格\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>1</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-roll-note{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;width:82px;height:16px;border:0;border-radius:3px;padding:0 6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--note-mid);color:var(--note-text);cursor:grab;transition:background-color 140ms,color 140ms,border-color 140ms;}.ds-roll-note span{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}.ds-roll-note:hover{filter:brightness(1.17)}.ds-roll-note[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{outline:1px solid var(--text);outline-offset:1px}.ds-roll-note:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-roll-note{transition:none}}.ds-roll-note.ds-low{background:var(--note-low)}.ds-roll-note.ds-high{background:var(--note-high)}.ds-roll-note.ds-command{background:var(--gold)}.ds-roll-note.ds-sounding{background:var(--gold);filter:brightness(1.25)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "黛青与墨绿工作台",
    "overview": "黛青与墨绿承托高密度编排界面，暖白用于阅读，暗金标出操作、焦点与播放位置。细线划分时间和音高，装饰集中在应用标记。\n\n中文文案直接说明动作和状态。宋体标题与平台中文无衬线正文配合，深浅主题保留相同的信息层级。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "音高与时间是视觉主体。",
      "辅助区可折叠，工作区随窗口伸展。",
      "状态通过位置、图标、文字与颜色共同表达。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The 音符文字 Rule",
        "body": "音符文字使用独立的 note-text 色，按深浅主题分别配对低、中、高音背景。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The 平面分层 Rule",
        "body": "常驻区域以底色和细线区分，投影用于浮层与游标。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 复用深浅主题的同名色彩角色。",
      "Do 为键盘焦点保留暗金轮廓，并保留减少动态效果设置。",
      "Do 让信息密度服从编辑操作，说明文字紧邻相关控件。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 用装饰占用编排空间。",
      "Don't 只用颜色说明选中、连接或演奏状态。"
    ]
  }
}
